NOTE ON DATA

This licence covers the source code. The contents of the `data/` directory may be
derived from third-party sources under different terms — in particular OpenStreetMap
data, which is licensed under the Open Database License (ODbL) and requires
attribution and share-alike. See `data/README.md`.

NOTE ON SAFETY

SailWise is decision-support software. It is not a navigation instrument and its
output is not a safety clearance. Always verify official weather forecasts,
navigational warnings and local safety information before going on the water.
